    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSpacious and beautifully presented four-bedroom semi-detached home, ideally located in the popular Glenbrook Estate in Knock. \n\nSet over three floors, this attractive property offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The ground floor comprises a welcoming sitting room, kitchen and dining room. \n\nThe bedrooms are arranged across the upper floors, with the top floor comprising a spacious bedroom with its own walk-in wardrobe, creating an impressive and private space. \n\nGlenbrook Estate is conveniently located close to the centre of Knock and within easy reach of local shops, schools and amenities. The property is just minutes away from the N17, providing excellent road links to Claremorris, Galway and Sligo, while Ireland West Airport Knock is approximately 15 minutes away. \n\nThe property also benefits from fibre broadband, ideal for those working from home. \n\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.5m x 2m\nWith timber laminate floor and carpet staircase leading to the first floor.\n\nSitting Room - 4.4m x 3.6m\nWith timber laminate floor, a solid fuel fireplace with in-set stove, granite surround and timber mantlepiece and double doors leading to the kitchen/dining room.\n\nDining Room - 5.3m x 3.8m\nWith timber laminate floor and double doors leading to the rear of the house.\n\nKitchen - 2.8m x 3.2m\nWith tile floor and fitted kitchen with tile splashback.\n\nUtility Room - 1.2m x 2m\nWith built-in shelving, a worktop and accomodation for washer and dryer.\n\nWC - 1.5m x 2m\nWith tile floor, wash hand basin and WC.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.9m x 3.2m\nDouble room to the front of the house with large winodw allowing for lots of natural light.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.6m x 2.4m\nFully tiled with WC, wash hand basin and corner shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.2m x 3.6m\nDouble room to the rear of the house with timber lamiante floor and an alcove to accomodate a built-in wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.3m x 3m\nSingle room to the rear of the house with timber laminate floor.\n\nBathroom - 2.2m x 2m\nFully tiled with wash hand basin, WC and shower.\n\nHotpress - 0.9m x 1.1m\nWith shelving.\n\nLanding - \nWith staircase leading to the second floor.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.7m x 5.2m\nWith carpet floor and walk-in wardrobe (2m x 1.6)\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
