        "Content": "<ul><li>Mid-Terrace House</li><li>Stone Front</li><li>Cobble-lock Path and Driveway</li><li>Oil-Fired Central Heating </li><li>Concrete Panelled Fence</li><li>Timber Decking to the rear</li><li>Lawn Area to the rear</ul>"
